SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                1000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  100
PrintEvery                    100

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
CutOffCoulomb                 12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

ComputeSurfaceArea            yes
SurfaceAreaSamplingPointsPerSphere 1000
SurfaceAreaProbeDistance      Minimum
SurfaceAreaProbeAtom          Argon

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 2
ExternalTemperature 298.0
ExternalPressure 1e5

Component 0 MoleculeName       Argon
            MoleculeDefinition local
            SurfaceAreaProbability 1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0